{"availability":"available","full":"vpslog/passive-income","name":"passive-income","description":"服务器被动收入。服务器挂机一键脚本。","category":"Other","language":"Shell","stars":30,"forks":2,"created":"2024-12-03T08:15:23Z","updated":"2025-11-11T03:58:24Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://passive-income.pages.dev/","topics":[],"demo":"https://passive-income.pages.dev/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:44.028Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:44.028Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:44.028Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T14:47:44.028Z","stars":30,"forks":2}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":[],"features":["原理：共享服务器的IP地址给挂机平台，挂机平台将统一将IP地址出租给用户，用于运行爬虫等需要频繁切换不同IP/区域的程序。根据代理的流量，返回一些收益给提供者。","限制条件：主要是对服务器的IP地址有限制，一般需要独立的IPv4地址，另外家庭宽带的收益比机房IP更高。部分挂机服务仅限家庭宽带。","风险提示：由于会将本机IP地址共享给客户用于运行程序，无法确保其中没有恶意程序。这里收集的几个平台经过测试风险较低。但仍然建议提前了解商家 TOS，不要在运行重要服务的机器上运行挂机脚本。挂机可能导致服务器被封。 目前挂了一年将近一百台机，就有一台被检测到问题。务必不要在大厂（国内阿里云等，国外 GCP 等）上运行。不要在国内机器上运行。 建议灵车商家搭配挂机脚本。"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/vpslog/passive-income/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"a6404511e7e5f6be97911b50647720da32ff4e0de2327a4b797a47be0d129d82","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:44.179Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:44.179Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":null,"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"a6404511e7e5f6be97911b50647720da32ff4e0de2327a4b797a47be0d129d82","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/vpslog/passive-income/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:44.179Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-11-11T03:58:24Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/vpslog/passive-income/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-07T14:47:44.179Z","hash":"a6404511e7e5f6be97911b50647720da32ff4e0de2327a4b797a47be0d129d82","originalBytes":3752,"storedBytes":3752,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["aff","api","key","usdt","packetstream","repocket","token","vps","application","docker","earnfm","gcp","int